<title>USA: MedImmune Inc Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>MedImmune Inc Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Statements of Operations (unaudited)</p>
<p>		    (in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					  September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p>  Product sales	     $4,632  $3,821     $18,086  $11,121</p>
<p>  Contracts			148   2,843	 5,055    9,330</p>
<p>    Total			4,780   6,664	23,141   20,451</p>
<p>Costs and expenses:</p>
<p>  Cost of sales		2,924   2,295	11,046    7,763</p>
<p>Research and development</p>
<p>				   7,817   5,965	20,059   20,524</p>
<p>Selling, admin and general</p>
<p>				   5,043   2,511	13,602    7,169</p>
<p>    Total		     15,784  10,771	44,707   35,456</p>
<p> Interest income, net	  842     361	 2,796	924</p>
<p> Net loss		   (10,162) (3,746)    (18,770) (14,081)</p>
<p> Loss per share	     (0.47)  (0.22)	(0.90)   (0.90)</p>
<p>Shares used in</p>
<p>  computing loss	    21,656  16,722	20,782   15,600</p>
<p>NOTE: The company took a Q3 1996 charge against product sales of about $740,000 related to the bankruptcy of one of its largest customers, a pharmaceutical wholesaler. It said it did not expect the status of the wholesaler to have a negative impact on future quarterly results.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
